#. <CLT 4>今更、時計なんか気にしても仕方がないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's the point in even looking at the clock now...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんが散々試したはずだ…
#. ボクなんかが壊すのは到底不可能だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure Sakura tried to tear these down more than\n"
"once. If she couldn't do it, what chance do I have...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちも鉄板…あっちも鉄板…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plate here... Metal plate over there, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Tấm kim loại ở đây... Đằng kia cũng là tấm kim loại.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>机の上には、あの安っぽいパンフレット…
#. 置きっぱなしになっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The little pamphlet is still laying there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Cuốn tờ rơi nhỏ vẫn còn nằm ở đó...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここから、ボクの絶望は始まったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where all my despair began...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
